Alembic migrations for the real-mail-otp backend.

env.py is async-aware and reads DATABASE_URL from app.core.config.get_settings()
(NOT from alembic.ini). target_metadata = app.db.session.Base.metadata.

Run from the backend/ directory:

    alembic upgrade head        # apply all migrations
    alembic downgrade -1        # roll back one
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "message"   # new migration

Migration 0001_initial creates all 7 tables + the two critical UNIQUE
constraints (billing dedupe + messages(inbox_id, mid)) BEFORE any charge code.
